NOT recommended for the serving path, on the measurements in
experiments/campaign2/gazetteer_hygiene_report.md:
  * R2 demote_h  -- net +2 entities in 8,977 under the frozen ranker.
  * R3 dedupe    -- a convention swap, -112 (keep P) / -1,500 (keep A) on a
                    fixed denominator, while the campaign's conditioned metric
                    goes UP because the deleted rows were golds.
  * R4 demote_junk -- +0.003 TLG-hard on its own, +19 on `Mauna Kea`; worth
                    folding in ONLY as part of an index rebuild, not as a
                    serving-time drop, because it depends on a threshold this
                    census sized on one string family.
